status GREEN -- awk_lcg_exact at overflowing=0 unread=17 WITH THE CONTROL TRACKED, its control at 57 legs 0 failing; torus_fold 28 and workload_trial 62 re-proven after the generator moved; ten ledger guards GREEN including reds_ledger_monotone and reds_shelf_name. standing_equipment reds on 16 recorded run states that stand on the committed tree unchanged by this lap, checked both ways.
recommend check-in (either) -- two open words. key_trade_control.sh stands at 1.260x of headroom, clear of the gate and one ordinary edit from it: pin that modulus in a comment, or leave the wall to catch it? And the general one this lap found the hard way: how many other guards in this tree read a population that holds their own control?
